# VS3-3b/W5 P2 soak — log
# Branch vs3/w5-spike, baseline f5a243f (P2 0b4ad7e đã merge).
# Example: crates/vis-cli/examples/vs3_worker_eval_p2_soak.rs (396 dòng, test-only).
# Toolchain: ~/.cargo/bin/cargo 1.100.0.

## CONFIG SOAK
VS3_SOAK_SECS=1800; 8 task CPU × 20.000 vòng; 10.000 spawn/await; budget 10.000/chunk 256;
cancel-after 5 ms (task 2M vòng); cross-write W=1/W=4; RSS/threads/fd mỗi batch.
Mỗi batch so output/exit/codes W=1/2/4; dừng ngay nếu assert.

